{"2626570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GodsTV", "steam_appid": 2626570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GodsTV is a 90’s inspired action roguelite, drenched in humor, fame-lust, and chaos. Shoot and slice in fast paced shows, farm aura, craft your build and earn the Gods favor on your ascension to Godhood. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/6eded97097c68cc32cb84a6d01b8b516.avif?t=1787065310\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras_big/6eded97097c68cc32cb84a6d01b8b516.webp?t=1787065310 width=1560 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/3be5f54e0931e52f7b2674e2ecaca881.poster.avif?t=1787065310\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/3be5f54e0931e52f7b2674e2ecaca881.webm?t=1787065310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/3be5f54e0931e52f7b2674e2ecaca881.mp4?t=1787065310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gods™ of the Capitalypse feed off ratings. They™ demand blood, laughs and drama in exchange for heavenly upgrades. If you want to get far in this show you must gain the ultimate power: Fame. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/ca9bb25e76fe6362cb512fac7114ded6.avif?t=1787065310\" width=1560 height=272 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/28ace8d8c6bd7e3144d24a3734cfc37b.poster.avif?t=1787065310\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/28ace8d8c6bd7e3144d24a3734cfc37b.webm?t=1787065310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/28ace8d8c6bd7e3144d24a3734cfc37b.mp4?t=1787065310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as four distinct playstyles: Kinni, the Stripper Bruiser: Leetah, the Ninja Popstar; Pepperishi, the Pizza Shaman; and V1KTU$, the Gadget Master.  Combine your contender with unique Godskins, weapons, and signature moves to create your own fighting style and woo your fans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/82d3e4e14c633fd002133c3001122316.avif?t=1787065310\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras_big/82d3e4e14c633fd002133c3001122316.webp?t=1787065310 width=1560 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/fe45cbda4861121ac4023eacd9b9f817.poster.avif?t=1787065310\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/fe45cbda4861121ac4023eacd9b9f817.webm?t=1787065310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/fe45cbda4861121ac4023eacd9b9f817.mp4?t=1787065310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To earn the endorsement of the Gods you have to get famous! The more fame you accumulate, the stronger the powers the Gods give to you. Please them, and you’ll unlock your star potential with addictive skins, upgrades, and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/132dfaa132e0f6c562cb2b1f052d331f.poster.avif?t=1787065310\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/132dfaa132e0f6c562cb2b1f052d331f.webm?t=1787065310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/132dfaa132e0f6c562cb2b1f052d331f.mp4?t=1787065310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Die or win to visit the Backstage! Upgrade your Contenders and craft your build for the next show. Mingle with the staff of the Show: your shady AI-Gent and his shady deals, your jaded star coach, and the rest of the spicy cast. Make friends, enemies… and maybe even lovers, if you play your cards right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/c1e7397e7f936f169f245b25d20ec634.avif?t=1787065310\" width=1024 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GodsTV is a 90’s inspired action roguelite, drenched in humor, fame-lust, and chaos. Shoot and slice in fast paced shows, farm aura, craft your build and earn the Gods favor on you